  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkey Relief Tour to Support Earthquake Survivors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disasters can only be overcome with solidarity, which is why Clown Me In will be working with Clowns Without Borders on the ground to alleviate the sufferings of people in Turkey, who have been affected by the earthquake that hit the country on Feb 6. Providing psychosocial support is crucial to enable people to process what has happened and deal with the trauma, the same way we successfully did after the explosion in Beirut. A little girl who had stopped talking, talked after one of our shows!</narrative>
  </description>
